00:51:16,940 --> 00:51:20,060
bretokinin and substance
P, which I said before.

737
00:51:20,300 --> 00:51:23,840
Olmosartin is associated
with sprue-like enteropathy,

738
00:51:23,840 --> 00:51:27,500
severe diarrhea, and weight
loss. Combinations of RAS

739
00:51:27,500 --> 00:51:29,960
inhibitors should be avoided
due to increased risk

740
00:51:29,960 --> 00:51:33,780
of hypotension, syncope, renal
impairment, and hyperkalemia.

741
00:51:33,780 --> 00:51:36,880
RAS inhibitors are
contraindicated during pregnancy

742
00:51:36,880 --> 00:51:40,620
because of the risk of
fetal hypotension, anuria,

743
00:51:40,620 --> 00:51:45,900
and renal failure leading
to oligohydramnios. Fetal

744
00:51:45,900 --> 00:51:49,280
malformations and death may
occur. And that concludes

745
00:51:49,280 --> 00:51:55,380
part one of the lectures
on antihypertensive agents.

746
00:51:55,900 --> 00:51:56,380
Thank you.